"body": "<p>We welcomed clients and industry professionals to our Q3 Market Insight Breakfast Briefing, where we shared findings from our latest London Residential Research Report and discussed the key issues influencing the residential market. The discussion covered a number of important topics, including: The ongoing challenges surrounding affordability for purchasers. Current market conditions and the outlook for the London residential property market. The latest Budget announcement, including the proposed Your First Home Scheme and its potential implications for both the private sale and Shared Ownership markets. Against a backdrop of continued change, the briefing provided a valuable opportunity to exchange perspectives, explore the challenges facing the sector and consider what lies ahead. A big thank you to all our clients and industry colleagues who joined us, and our guest speaker Debra Yudolph of Say Property Consultants. We really valued your contributions and the opportunity to share these discussions. Our latest research report offers insights into the London residential property market and the developments shaping the sector. You can access your copy here:</p><p>‍<a href=\"https://regenta.co.uk/research-breakfast/london-residential-research-q3-26-download\" target=\"_blank\">https://regenta.co.uk/research-breakfast/london-residential-research-q3-26-download</a></p>"
