"iso": "2025-09-15",
"date": "15 September 2025",
"summary": "Regenta was proud to be the headline sponsor of this year’s First Time Buyer Readers'​ Awards. Supporting first-time buyers isn’t just a service we provide; it’s a core priority that shapes everything we do. We were especially proud to see Makers Yard, a scheme delivered in partnership with Riverside, recognised as ‘Best Large Development’ on the day.",
