"cat": "Market insight",
"body": "<p>Last week we hosted our Market Research Breakfast at The Ivy with a small group of key clients, where we discussed our research, analysis and data from Q4 2024. Discussions focused on challenges in today's market, private sale popularity, Shared Ownership affordability and the customers perception and understanding of service charges. Thank you to our clients that attended, these open discussions on factors that are affecting us all in the industry prove invaluable and we look forward to hosting our next session at the end of Q1.</p>"
