"summary": "Last week our Faber Green development in Northolt, on behalf of SNG (Sovereign Network Group) received its final completion. Consistently achieving a minimum of 6 sales a month since launch, the development proved to be a success with not only a fantastic, dedicated sales team on site, but an ideal collaboration with SNG.",
